le: You scrape the rod with this metal scraper to produce fine flecks of metal.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_02_27","text":"When that makes contact with the air, it oxidizes and... poof!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_02_28","text":"Sparks fly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_02_29","text":"If the rod's surface is smooth, it means there's no more metal left to scrape.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_02_30","text":"That's why it doesn't produce sparks anymore.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_02_31","text":"... Probably.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_02_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_02_32","text":"Probably?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_02_33","text":"Well, there was a... minor incident recently","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_02_34","text":"that may have damaged it somewhat.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_02_35","text":"But it shouldn't be ruined to the point of being unusable!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_02_36","text":"If Guy vs. Wild says it's fine, it shouldn't be an issue.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_02_37","text":"That host, Grizzly Grills, is never wrong!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_02_38","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_02_38","text":"If that guy says so, then it's probably legit.","jump":"treasurestory_tove_02_40","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_02_39","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_02_39","text":"Are you sure we can trust that information?","jump":"treasurestory_